WEBVTT

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.280
Awesome.

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:48.600
It's spectacular.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.470
Viva resort training camp!

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:56.950
Super awesome!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.130
Mother Nature in all her splendor.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.600
But it's so cold.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.430
There!

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:06.450
How dare you throw snow at the King, insolent fool!

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.460
Return fire!

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.680
Roger-dechu!

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.140
Ah, that's cold!

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:13.230
This looks fun!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.020
Let's join in! Join in!

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:19.440
So where is Kukai's grandpa's place that we're staying at?

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.240
Maybe that's it?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.080
Wow!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.060
Wonderful!

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:25.270
Is Kukai really rich?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.230
Huh?

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:27.310
Of course not.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.350
It's o-ver there.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:32.560
A temple?

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.310
No!

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:37.300
So we're not staying at a snowy mountain resort?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.430
I told you it'd be a temple on the snowy mountain resort grounds.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.850
Where my grandpa lives.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.930
Repent!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.990
Let's go skiing.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:53.970
Y-You tricked us!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:58.970
The Snow Mountain Holiday!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:58.970
Episode 11

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.960
Everybody having fun?

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.580
Stop! This isn't like me!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:19.850
Why not? Why not?

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:20.890
It's fun, right?

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.020
Well, that's true.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.180
This is<i> pretty fun!</i>

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.420
Wow!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.520
Amu-chan's really into it!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.060
That's no fair!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.060
She Character Changed with Ran!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.290
Kukai!

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.910
We can't let them show us up!

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:35.790
Okay!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.850
Let's go, Daichi!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.390
Character Change!

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:41.140
Yahoo!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.930
It's on, Hinamori!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.070
You got it!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.100
I'm not gonna lose!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.600
Not bad, Hinamori!

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.890
Same to you!

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:06.360
Amu-chan!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:06.970
Yeah.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.350
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.290
It's dangerous to play out here.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.220
Build your snowman near the bottom.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.430
Okay.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:47.060
Cold.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.540
Of course you're cold!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.430
Her nose is running.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.220
And she's the heroine.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:59.640
Amu-chi, save me!

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.640
Wait up!

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:00.930
Yaya, I'm coming!

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.270
Fools!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.930
I told you to return before dark!

00:05:16.930 --> 00:05:18.670
Sorry, Grandpa.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.200
We got a little carried away.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.020
Repent!

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:23.250
A little carried away, you say?

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.850
This proves that you are slacking!

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:26.930
Clean the hallway to cleanse your soul!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.640
Clean the hallway?

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.810
So long!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.200
How are we supposed to clean this?

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:36.950
There's no way.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:37.890
Fools!

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.430
There's no method to it!

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.930
Polish little by little, and it will become clean.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.270
Stop focusing on the easy way out!

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:49.600
Even the longest of journeys must begin from the first step.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.360
Okay!

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.680
Start cleaning!

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.430
Clean! Clean!

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.430
Why must I, the King, clean?

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.350
No cheating!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.020
Scrub hard! Scrub hard, Amu-chan!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.850
Clean! Clean! Sparkly cle-

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.880
You help, too!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.640
What a pain.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.270
I'm sick of this-dechu!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.260
I can't take any more-dechu!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.260
What a pain!

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:23.410
Yuiki-san, calm down.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:23.410
I'm hungry!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.120
Okay.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:24.810
Then Yaya...

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.340
Let's race around the temple.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:28.410
Race?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.130
Ready, go!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.640
Wait up!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:33.730
That looks fun!

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.010
I'll join in!

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:35.780
Okay!

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:36.560
Me, too!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.330
Well now, when it comes to cleaning...

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:43.100
I ain't gonna lose!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.140
Outta the way!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:52.360
I'll run you over if you don't move!

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.560
Final lap!

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:07.830
Here!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.480
Man, I'm exhausted.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:18.370
But that was fun!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.430
Who said you could have fun?

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.680
Fools!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:28.870
After all that cleaning...

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.850
We have to cook?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:30.270
I'm so sorry.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.560
It's my fault.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.580
It's fine. No big deal.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:33.270
Don't worry about it.

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.550
Amu-chan, I'm hungry.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.430
I'm on the verge of starving to death.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.830
I think I just heard something.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:44.810
I-It's your imagination! Just your imagination.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.270
It is?

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:55.380
Huh?

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.390
What?

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:01.150
I can't cut this carrot!

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:01.870
No way!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:11.720
I wonder how long it will take us to make dinner.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:15.200
It looks like it's time for me to step in!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:15.920
Su!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:19.390
Chip! Syrup! Whip!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.510
If it's cooking you need, just leave it to me!

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:24.630
Gross. What's with the cutesy-girl act?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:26.680
This is so not me!

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.300
This is fabulous, Amu-chi!

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:42.520
Not bad, Hinamori!

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:44.850
You'll make a wonderful wife.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.000
A w-wife?

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:52.620
The wife having to cook is so old-fashioned!

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.220
Like, Stone Age old.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.970
She's being stubborn again.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.470
Did you really make this?

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.180
I thought we only had enough ingredients for curry.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.350
I'm, uh, what do you call it...

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.720
It's no big deal!

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.690
Let's dig in!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.720
Let's!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.820
The weather's nice again today!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.720
Okay, let's have a blast!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.270
I wonder what that is.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.290
Snow Festival Snow Sculpting Contest

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.010
A snow sculpting contest?

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.160
For making snow sculptures?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.390
Are those made out of snow, too?

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.930
Feel free to participate.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.850
Let's see...

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.470
First place receives...

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.010
A voucher for a free stay at a fancy hotel?

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.430
It's that hotel!

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.180
Yeah!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:41.890
Ah.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:42.680
Yeah!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.390
Huh?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.020
We're definitely gonna win!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.060
Y-Yeah.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.310
So we chisel away at this, huh?

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.420
What should we make?

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.900
How about a castle?

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:06.470
One fit for princes and princesses to live in.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.810
Did you just say "prince?"

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.180
It would appear the time has finally come!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:16.470
To build a castle for the King!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.970
Now, loyal subjects!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.470
Slave for me!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.100
Take your positions!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:27.820
I-In that case, we'll assign a different part to each person.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:29.600
I'll make the roof.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:31.520
Then I'll make the grounds.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:34.310
I'll make cute decorations!

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:38.020
I shall craft a tower which will look down upon the world!

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.880
A-Amu-chan, what's that?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.660
C-Can't you tell?

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.960
It's the gate. The gate.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.830
Looks like the gate to Hell.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.560
I can feel death beckoning.

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:54.010
I'm just not cut out for this stuff.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.930
It's not me.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.800
Hey, wait a second. 

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.060
I could do this in no time with a Character Change!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.580
Miki, you're good at this stuff, right?

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.220
If I Character Change with you...

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:03.990
Not a chance.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.100
Just like that?

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.590
Wh-Why not?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.120
It feels like cheating.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:08.990
Not at all!

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:13.720
You're the one who said Character Changes bring out my hidden talents.

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:17.410
So I can use my own abilities however I want, right?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:23.580
Character Changes and Character Transformations are just your hidden potential.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:26.180
They're not your own abilities yet.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.800
I can't do it.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.520
I'm not cut out for this.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.430
Do you like yourself when you say those things?

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:40.400
If you act that way, your potential might disappear.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.810
What's with her?

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.000
I'll start with a ball.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.840
That was fun.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:54.180
Sorry, I went out of control again.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.360
Tomorrow's the last day.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.050
We have to work hard.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.740
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.680
Oh, it's nothing.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:04.080
Hey, let's go buy souvenirs.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.690
I'm hungry, too!

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.670
There's a hot spring mall nearby.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.640
Wanna head there?

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.180
Sure.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.560
Delicious!

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.470
Stop that!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.370
I can't do it.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.410
I'm not cut out for this.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:33.450
Do you like yourself when you say those things?

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.660
That's...

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:37.740
That's just who I am.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:38.530
Seriously.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.720
After you pop out of nowhere,

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:42.060
and abuse me like that...

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.510
Wait for me!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.500
I got to eat buns and I bought souvenirs.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.720
I'm totally satisfied!

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.300
Yaya-chan.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:02.660
Oh no, I forgot to buy something!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.770
Oh dear, that's awful.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:05.150
Let's go back immediately!

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.450
Why not tomorrow?

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.760
Come on! Come on!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.570
Hey!

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.950
Ah, you two should head back without us!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.270
Wh-What just happened?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.490
Beats me.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:18.720
Shall we head back by ourselves, then?

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.190
By ourselves?

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.780
A graveyard.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:35.900
Are you scared?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.890
A-As if!

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:40.370
Monsters and ghosts couldn't possibly exist.

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:41.930
They could.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.600
Since Guardian Characters exist.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:44.350
Uh...

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.610
Don't worry.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.350
I'm with you.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.190
Watch your step.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.420
O-Okay.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.790
He might feel my heart pounding through my hand.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.750
I hope I'm not sweating!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.770
A-Anyway, I need to say something.

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:09.510
S-Say...

00:14:09.510 --> 00:14:10.270
Yes?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.900
U-Um, what was it again?

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:13.910
That's right.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.960
A while back, you said you have someone you like.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:16.850
Who might that-

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:18.410
I'm an idiot.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:21.660
Why am I revisiting the pain of heartbreak?

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.270
Oh, that.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.440
A dog?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.270
She's a girl.

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:29.010
Her name's Betty.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.540
We'd been together since I was born, but she died last year.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.090
So the person you like...

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:38.060
She was definitely the girl I liked most.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.650
I'm not very good at handling confessions.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.870
So I always Character Change and let Kiseki turn girls down.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:51.530
But now, there is a girl who's always on my mind.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.560
Huh?

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:56.550
She suddenly appeared before me.

00:14:56.550 --> 00:15:00.280
We were both Guardians, so I felt it was wrong.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.810
But I couldn't forget about her.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.810
Could he mean...

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.810
I'm just going to say it, Hinamori-san!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:10.180
Y-Yes!

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:16.430
It was the first time I'd ever seen a girl so bright, cheerful, and strong!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.680
A girl like Amulet Heart!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.310
What?

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:26.680
So, uh, you like me after a Character Transformation?

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.890
"L-Like" may not be exactly...

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.260
What's that?!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.640
S-Sorry!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.030
It's okay.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.140
He doesn't even consider the real me.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:52.600
Did we scare you?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.660
Oh, it was you guys.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.930
You weren't supposed to make any noise!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:57.940
Really?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.180
Let's go, Hinamori-san.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:25.520
So cold.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.220
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.920
Oh, I couldn't fall asleep.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.000
I see.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.310
Tadase-kun said that he likes Amulet Heart.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.970
That was a surprise.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:44.140
But Amulet Heart isn't me.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.020
That's not true!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.970
You don't have to comfort me.

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.520
Amu-chan.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.890
I guess this is what you'd call a broken heart?

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:10.800
Amu-chan!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:11.180
Huh?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.180
Hey, what was that?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:17.150
Amulet Heart is who you want to be.

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.150
So, um...

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.660
Amulet Heart exists inside of you, and...

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:23.180
So that means...

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.020
Ran.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:29.160
Character Changes and Character Transformations are just your hidden potential.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.660
They're not your own abilities yet.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:34.810
I can't do it.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.550
I'm just not cut out for this.

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:39.430
If you act that way, your potential might disappear.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.430
So basically...

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.500
Who you want to be is...

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.210
Um...

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.800
Stop focusing on the easy way out!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.720
Even the longest of journeys must begin from the first step.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.310
The longest journeys have to start from the first step, huh?

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:55.520
Yeah, yeah!

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.890
That's it! That's it!

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:03.060
Ran, that looks so weird!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.330
What do you mean, weird?

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:08.720
Thanks, Ran.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.970
Amu-chan.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:12.890
It's the middle of the night.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.100
Come here, too, guys.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.970
Amu-chan!

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.350
Who I want to be, huh?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.140
I have a long way to go.

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:29.320
But if I work hard, I'll get closer, I guess.

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.270
Yep!

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.810
Definitely.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.390
I'm sleepy.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.930
It's still early.

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:50.630
Where are we going?

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:54.020
I'm gonna fix the places I screwed up yesterday.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.700
I can't do a good job.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.680
You don't want to Character Change?

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.350
No.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.830
I should keep trying.

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:30.810
I have to do it myself, step by step.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.300
Amu-chan!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:38.520
Work hard! Work hard! Amu-chan!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:40.180
Work hard!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:43.560
Amu-chan?

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:46.220
Huh? Why're you here?

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:50.150
I wanted to fix some places I screwed up on yesterday.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.640
You too, Amu-chan?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:53.600
Yeah.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.970
Well then, let's give it our best.

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:57.430
Yes.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.470
Huh?

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.640
Amu-chi and Nadeshiko!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.530
Yaya.

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.680
Everybody else, too?

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:05.810
Man.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:08.140
I wanted to do it in secret!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.640
Guess you guys beat us to it.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.850
Everybody had the same thing in mind.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.580
Okay!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.750
Let's do this!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:16.970
Yeah!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.350
Look! Look!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.450
Even if things don't go the way I want...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.680
Step by step...

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.920
Even if it's only a little at a time,

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.680
if I can get closer to who I want to be...

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:43.640
I wondered why they were sneaking around this morning.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:48.050
My castle is complete!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.020
Uh, what is this?

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.080
Amu-chan's creation still looks like the gate to Hell.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.720
And Kukai's turned into soccer balls for some reason.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:58.320
Nadeshiko made a Japanese-style roof.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.800
Yaya-tan made ribbons-dechu.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.140
And Tadase created this viewing tower!

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.770
The world shall be ours!

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:07.100
When did it turn into this?

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:22.020
Best Entry

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:22.020
Why?!

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:25.350
We didn't win in the end.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.490
That not surprising, though.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.070
It was still fun.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:29.640
Yep.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.790
Right?

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:34.850
Grandpa.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:38.400
That was an unfortunate result.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.720
Guess so.

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:41.430
Uh, how did you know about that?

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:46.180
Well, it's a good thing to have accomplished something on your own.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.490
I made lunch for everyone today.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:52.680
A full course of my special vegetarian diet!

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:55.050
What? Vegetarian?

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:56.690
A full course, too.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:57.640
Fools!

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.180
Don't act so spoiled!

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.450
I am rather hungry.

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:02.770
I wonder what will be served.

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:03.710
I can't wait.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:04.470
Okay.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:05.750
Let's hurry back and eat!

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:20.040
Best Effort

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:54.090
Do you guys remember the girl who was with Ikuto before?

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.470
Yep, she was really pretty.

00:23:56.470 --> 00:23:58.060
She's a singer.

00:23:58.060 --> 00:23:59.090
Really?

00:23:59.090 --> 00:24:00.380
What a surprise.

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:02.670
I wonder how she's connected to Ikuto.

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:03.660
Are you worried?

00:24:03.660 --> 00:24:04.770
N-Not the least bit!

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:07.830
Anyway, I can't wait for the Christmas party!

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:10.210
She's worried! She's worried!

00:24:10.210 --> 00:24:11.580
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:13.170
A Sad Christmas Eve!

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:13.690
Huh?

00:24:13.690 --> 00:24:16.290
Please spare me from a sad Christmas Eve!

00:24:16.290 --> 00:24:17.570
Something sad will happen?

00:24:17.570 --> 00:24:20.020
On Christmas Eve?
